{
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": { "type": "grafana", "uid": "-- Grafana --" },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "description": "RED metrics, logs and trace correlation for the sample Go service.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Request rate",
      "description": "Requests per second across every instrumented route.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 2,
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "text" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "text", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total{job=\"go-app\", route=~\"$route\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "req/s"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Error rate",
      "description": "Share of requests answered with a 5xx. The sample app fails ~8% of /work calls on purpose; the ~3% of 4xx are not counted here.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "#EAB839", "value": 0.05 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.15 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total{job=\"go-app\", route=~\"$route\", status=~\"5..\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(http_requests_total{job=\"go-app\", route=~\"$route\"}[5m])), 1e-9)",
          "legendFormat": "error ratio"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Latency p95",
      "description": "95th percentile request duration.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 3,
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "#EAB839", "value": 0.5 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"go-app\", route=~\"$route\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "In flight",
      "description": "Requests currently being served. A number that climbs and never comes back down means handlers are stuck.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "text" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "text", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(http_requests_in_flight{job=\"go-app\"})",
          "legendFormat": "in flight"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request rate by route",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": { "group": "A", "mode": "none" },
            "axisSoftMin": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "showLegend": true, "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (route) (rate(http_requests_total{job=\"go-app\", route=~\"$route\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Errors by route (5xx)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 70,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": { "group": "A", "mode": "normal" },
            "axisSoftMin": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "showLegend": true, "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (route) (rate(http_requests_total{job=\"go-app\", route=~\"$route\", status=~\"5..\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latency percentiles",
      "description": "The dots are exemplars. Click one to jump straight to the trace that produced that latency sample.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 3,
          "min": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "axisSoftMin": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "exemplar": true,
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"go-app\", route=~\"$route\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "exemplar": true,
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"go-app\", route=~\"$route\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "exemplar": true,
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"go-app\", route=~\"$route\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heatmap",
      "title": "Latency distribution",
      "description": "The full histogram over time. Percentile lines hide bimodal behaviour; a heatmap does not.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 13 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "custom": { "hideFrom": { "legend": false, "tooltip": false, "viz": false } } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": {
        "calculate": false,
        "cellGap": 1,
        "color": { "mode": "scheme", "scheme": "Turbo", "steps": 64, "reverse": false, "exponent": 0.5, "fill": "dark-orange" },
        "exemplars": { "color": "rgba(255,0,255,0.7)" },
        "filterValues": { "le": 1e-9 },
        "legend": { "show": true },
        "rowsFrame": { "layout": "auto" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single", "yHistogram": true },
        "yAxis": { "axisPlacement": "left", "reverse": false, "unit": "s" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "heatmap",
          "exemplar": true,
          "expr": "sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"go-app\", route=~\"$route\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{le}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Logs",
      "description": "Structured JSON logs shipped by Alloy. Expand a line and click its TraceID to open the matching trace in Tempo.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 11, "w": 16, "x": 0, "y": 22 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": false,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": false,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "sortOrder": "Descending"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "range",
          "expr": "{container=\"go-app\"} | json | line_format \"{{.level}} {{.msg}}{{if .route}} route={{.route}} status={{.status}} duration_ms={{.duration_ms}}{{end}}\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to use this dashboard",
      "gridPos": { "h": 11, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 22 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Follow one request across all three pillars\n\n**1. Metric → trace**\nOn *Latency percentiles*, click one of the exemplar dots. It opens the exact trace behind that latency sample in Tempo.\n\n**2. Log → trace**\nExpand any line in the *Logs* panel and click the **TraceID** link.\n\n**3. Trace → logs**\nInside a trace, use *Logs for this span* to get back to the lines that span emitted.\n\n---\n\n### Worth trying\n\n- **Service graph**: Explore → Tempo → *Service Graph* tab. Built from span metrics, no extra instrumentation.\n- **Errors only**: switch the Logs query to `{container=\"go-app\"} | json | level=\"ERROR\"`.\n- **Go runtime**: goroutines, heap and GC live on the other dashboard.\n- **Alerts**: rules live in `prometheus/rules/`; state is at [Alertmanager](http://localhost:9093).\n\n---\n\n*On purpose, the sample app answers ~3% of `/work` calls with a 400, fails ~8% with a 500, and sends 10% down a slow path. Without that these panels would have nothing to show.*"
      }
    }
  ],
  "preload": false,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": ["go", "observability", "red-method"],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
        "label": "Prometheus",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": ""
      },
      {
        "name": "DS_LOKI",
        "label": "Loki",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "loki",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": ""
      },
      {
        "name": "route",
        "label": "Route",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
        "query": { "qryType": 1, "query": "label_values(http_requests_total{job=\"go-app\"}, route)", "refId": "route" },
        "definition": "label_values(http_requests_total{job=\"go-app\"}, route)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": { "selected": true, "text": ["All"], "value": ["$__all"] },
        "hide": 0,
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "time": { "from": "now-15m", "to": "now" },
  "timepicker": { "refresh_intervals": ["5s", "10s", "30s", "1m", "5m"] },
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "Go App Overview",
  "uid": "go-app-overview",
  "version": 1,
  "weekStart": ""
}
